    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεν-δύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπενέδυσ᾽ ἐρραμμέν᾽ αὐτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					98.11
				</span></i>
			 (troch.):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῷ θώρακι χιτῶνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demoph.
					<u>Sim.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλισμῷ ὑπενδεδυμένοι
				χιτῶνας</span>
			<i>having</i> tunics <i>on under,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.595e
			</span></i>.</div>
